Database migrations
===================

Apply the schema, including the original-file table, from the repository root:

    python -m alembic upgrade head

After upgrading, import any legacy files in stored_documents/ and then verify
all original-file blobs against their version checksums:

    python scripts/migrate_document_files.py
    python scripts/migrate_document_files.py --verify-only

The utility never deletes or modifies local files. Retire legacy copies only
after a clean verification and after confirming the database backup policy.
The document_files downgrade refuses to drop stored file content.
